}", "readme_md": "# Northwind Health Terraform Bundle

## Architecture Overview

Deploys a secure, HIPAA-compliant three-tier .NET member claims portal in `us-chicago-1`:
- **Public Tier**: OCI WAF + Flexible Load Balancer (public subnet)
- **Private Web Tier**: 2x VM.Standard.E5.Flex (2 OCPU, 16 GB each)
- **Private App Tier**: 2x VM.Standard.E5.Flex (4 OCPU, 32 GB each) + 500 GB Block Volume (encrypted)
- **Private DB Tier**: Autonomous Database (4 OCPU, HA, private endpoint)
- **Storage**: Object Storage bucket (100 GB quota)
- **Security**: Private subnets, NSGs (tier isolation), IAM policies, Vault/KMS
- **Observability**: Logging Log Group, Monitoring alarm example

![Architecture](https://docs.oracle.com/en-us/iaas/Content/Balance/architecture.htm) (Conceptual)

## POC Alignment
- **Phase 1 (Week 1)**: Deploy infra (`terraform apply`)
- **Phase 2 (Weeks 2-3)**: App owner installs .NET app on web/app VMs (use SSH, userdata customization)
- **Phase 3 (Weeks 4-6)**: Security review NSGs/Vault, test p95 <300ms, 99.9% uptime, RTO <60min via Autonomous HA
- **Cost**: Targets 30% reduction vs on-premises (monitor via Cost Analysis)

## Prerequisites
- Terraform >= 1.5.0
- OCI CLI configured with API keys
- Compartment with required quotas (Compute E5.Flex, LB flexible, Autonomous DB)
- Group for DB access (update `group_name` var)

## Usage

1. **Save files**: `main.tf`, `variables.tf`, `outputs.tf`

2. **Customize vars** (e.g., `terraform.tfvars`):
   ```hcl
   compartment_id    = "ocid1.compartment.oc1..example"
   ssh_public_key    = "ssh-rsa AAAAB3N..."
   db_admin_password = "SecurePass123!"
   label_prefix      = "quality-northwind-"
   group_name        = "NorthwindDBAdmins"
   ```

3. **Deploy**:
   ```bash
   terraform init
   terraform plan
   terraform apply
   ```

4. **Outputs**:
   ```bash
   terraform output load_balancer_public_ip
   terraform output autonomous_db_connection_string
   ```

## Post-Deploy
- **HTTPS/WAF**: Update listener to HTTPS, add cert bundle, set `waf_policy_id` on listener
- **App Deployment**: SSH to web/app (private, use bastion/VPN), install .NET, configure health checks
- **DB**: Download wallet from Console, connect via private endpoint
- **Monitoring**: Extend alarms for p95 response (use APM/Logging Analytics)
- **Cost Optimization**: Right-size, reservations for prod
- **HIPAA**: Review Vault keys, NSGs, enable Data Safe

## Teardown
```bash
terraform destroy
```

## Known Limitations
- HTTP listener (upgrade to HTTPS)
- Autonomous DB used for HA simplicity (Base DB System possible but more complex Terraform)
- No bastion (use OCI Session/Console for access)
- Userdata not .NET-specific (customize metadata)
- No auto-scaling (fixed sizing)

## Success Criteria Outputs
- Access portal: `http://<lb_ip>` (post-app deploy)
- Metrics: Console > Monitoring > Query LB/Compute
- Cost: Console > Cost Analysis, compare to on-premises

For issues: Oracle solution architect."}, "artifact_key": "generated/terraform/bundle"}

