}", "readme_md": "# Northwind Health Terraform Bundle

This Terraform bundle deploys a secure, HIPAA-compliant three-tier .NET member claims portal architecture in OCI us-chicago-1.

## Architecture Overview
- **VCN**: 10.0.0.0/16 with public subnet (LB/WAF ingress), private-web, private-app, private-db subnets.
- **Security**: NSGs enforce tier-to-tier traffic (LB->web HTTP/S, web->app HTTP/S, app->db 1521). Private tiers, no public IPs.
- **Ingress**: Public Flexible Load Balancer (10-100 Mbps) with WAF policy, HTTP/80 listener to web backend set (health /health).
- **Web Tier**: 2x VM.Standard.E5.Flex (2 OCPU, 16 GB), private-web subnet.
- **App Tier**: 2x VM.Standard.E5.Flex (4 OCPU, 32 GB), private-app subnet, 500 GB encrypted Block Volume (KMS) attached to app1.
- **Database**: Oracle Base DB System (VM.Standard.E5.Flex, 2 OCPU/node x 2 nodes RAC HA, 32 GB mem/node, 512 GB storage), private-db subnet.
- **Storage**: 100 GB Object Storage bucket.
- **Security/Mgmt**: KMS Vault + key, IAM Dynamic Group + Policy (object read/write, KMS use, logging), Logging Log Group.
- **Monitoring**: OCI native metrics (extend with alarms as needed).

Matches POC sizing, services, private tiers, WAF/LB ingress, NSGs, IAM, Vault, Logging/Monitoring.

## Prerequisites
- OCI CLI configured (`oci setup config`).
- Terraform v1.5+.
- SSH key pair (public key value).
- Compartment with sufficient quotas (E5.Flex, DB Systems, LB, etc.).

## Variables
Set in `terraform.tfvars` or env vars:

```
tenancy_ocid = "ocid1.tenancy.oc1..aaaa..."
compartment_id = "ocid1.compartment.oc1..aaaa..."
region = "us-chicago-1"
label_prefix = "northwind-health"
ssh_public_key = "ssh-rsa AAAAB3N..."
```

## Deploy
```
terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply
```

## Outputs
```
load_balancer_ips
web_private_ips
app_private_ips
db_fqdn
db_admin_password (sensitive)
object_storage_bucket
kms_key_id
```
Access portal: http://<lb_ip>

## POC Validation (Phases 1-3)
- **Phase 1 (Wk1)**: Assess infra (terraform output, OCI Console: Networking/Security/Compute/Database).
- **Deploy .NET app**: SCP binaries/user-data to instances (ssh 10.0.1.10 etc via bastion if needed), configure app->db connection string `Server=10.0.3.x;Port=1521;User=sys;Pwd=<output>;`.
- **Phase 2-3 (Wk2-6)**: Test p95 <300ms, 99.9% avail, RTO<60min (simulate failover), cost 30% reduction (compare on-prem).
- **HIPAA**: Review NSGs/WAF/Vault/encryption/private subnets with security lead.

## Cleanup
`terraform destroy`

## Notes
- DB RAC HA (2 nodes), connect via SCAN/FQDN.
- Extend: HTTPS certs on LB, Monitoring alarms (CPU/avail), LB access logs to Logging, Windows images if needed.
- Quotas: Request DB System HA, Flex shapes if limited.
- Cost: ~$0.5/hr running (monitor Budgets)."}, "artifact_key": "generated/terraform/bundle"}

